{"id":"n16596-1-7","stage":3,"title":"생활비 · 生活费","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16596-1-7-1","ko":"경기가 어렵다고 월급마저 줄어서 걱정이에요.","zh":"听说经济形势不好，连工资都要削减了，真让人担心。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"경기가","meaning":"经济状况","explanation":"경기：经济状况；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"경기","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25710","senseId":"1","lemma":"경기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"경기가","audio":"/audio/1735f3414b564c4d1166.mp3"}},{"text":"어렵다고","meaning":"艰难，贫困","explanation":"어렵다：艰难，贫困；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"어렵다","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62232","senseId":"4","lemma":"어렵다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어렵다고","audio":"/audio/898f71b43aeaa9eaec16.mp3"}},{"text":"월급마저","meaning":"月薪，月工资","explanation":"월급：月薪，月工资；마저：表示“连……都、甚至……也”，常用于不利的情况。","readings":[{"term":"월급","audio":"/audio/c384db10210a9b769d7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69619","senseId":"1","lemma":"월급","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"월급마저","audio":"/audio/a8d48f9f29f4daf9567b.mp3"}},{"text":"줄어서","meaning":"减少","explanation":"줄다：减少；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"줄다","audio":"/audio/4a79f5ac1f29eb5f4299.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82138","senseId":"2","lemma":"줄다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줄어서","audio":"/audio/a4226c645fc9ee3b6d0f.mp3"}},{"text":"걱정이에요.","meaning":"担心，忧虑，担忧","explanation":"걱정：担心，忧虑，担忧；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"걱정","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17232","senseId":"1","lemma":"걱정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걱정이에요","audio":"/audio/026911a52e1dca50bfcd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e56314e9a18b80c1","term":"경기","zh":"经济状况","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3","entryId":"25710","defini